  "description": {
    "en": "Gamma Verve Soft is a soft co-polyester monofilament built with AMP Technology and a co-extrusion process that combines a soft core with stiffer outer prongs. The three-prong profile maximizes ball bite and spin while maintaining excellent comfort, control and vibration dampening, making it ideal for aggressive players who want polyester performance without excessive stiffness.",

    "zh": "Gamma Verve Soft 是一款采用 AMP Technology 与共挤结构（Co-Extrusion）的软质聚酯单丝球线。其柔软核心负责提升舒适性并吸收震动，外层三凸棱聚酯结构则增强咬球与旋转能力，在保证控制力的同时提供更高的容错性，是追求旋转但又不希望传统聚酯过硬的球员理想选择。"
  },

